  "home.hero.h1": "Skilled professionals and Ausbildung pathways for the German market",
  "home.hero.lede": "MEDA Vermittlung connects German employers with vetted profiles from Europe and selected third countries — via Ausbildung or skilled pathways, German B1/B2 (C1 welcome) and a viable immigration pathway.",
