  "home.why.h2": "Why companies mandate MEDA Vermittlung",
  "home.why.lead": "Sector by sector, with shortlists rather than mass applications — and clear quality filters for Ausbildung and skilled professionals.",
  "home.why.c1.h": "Qualification filter",
  "home.why.c1.p": "Vetted profiles on the right pathway (Ausbildung or skilled professional) and solid German. No unqualified helper profiles.",
  "home.why.c2.h": "International search",
  "home.why.c2.p": "Spain, Italy, Portugal, Eastern Europe and further markets abroad — focused on qualification, German and a viable pathway into Germany.",
  "home.why.c3.h": "Integration included",
  "home.why.c3.p": "With the <a href=\"integration.html#meda-one\">MEDA One app</a> (coming soon) and support from the MEDA AI assistant and our team: a checklist with deadlines, and finding a doctor and a Bürgeramt.",
  "home.why.c4.h": "Two sides, one process",
