  "home.integ.lead": "We support you as you start life in Germany. The MEDA One app helps you with everyday tasks.",
  "home.integ.c1.h": "You keep track of appointments and tasks and get reminders.",
  "home.integ.c1.p": "Every step with deadlines, from registration to your driving licence.",
