  "emp.hero.h1": "Skilled professionals for your site",
  "emp.hero.lead": "MEDA is your language and communication partner for staffing. Our team brings more than two years of placement practice and direct HR experience from a former Area Manager role. We support coordination between employer and candidate: clarifying the role, orientation on contract and residence, then practical help after arrival. Official decisions and legal advice stay with the competent authorities. The process stays traceable, and you can focus on your core business.",
  "emp.hero.alt": "Professional interview with European specialists",
  "emp.h2.1": "What you receive",
  "emp.li1": "Sector-specific search in healthcare, engineering, logistics and IT",
  "emp.li2": "Screening for academic degree and German proficiency",
  "emp.li3": "Short, reliable shortlists instead of unsorted applicant pools",
  "emp.li4": "Transparent communication on recognition, visa and start date",
  "emp.li5": "Integration support for candidates placed by MEDA Vermittlung",
  "emp.h2.2": "Who we work with",
  "emp.p2": "Hospitals and clinic groups, industrial and technology companies, logistics providers, and IT/digital organisations needing highly qualified permanent staff.",
  "emp.h2.3": "Compliance clarity",
  "emp.p3": "We provide pure placement. We do not offer temporary staffing (Arbeitnehmerüberlassung) without the required AÜG licence.",
  "emp.cta": "Submit a hiring need",
  "emp.img.alt": "Welcome at the start of work in a German office",
  "pro.hero.h1": "Your path to Ausbildung or a permanent role in Germany",
  "pro.hero.lead": "Three clear pathways: Ausbildung, healthcare professionals or other occupations. Choose pathway, language and experience, then view sample offers.",
  "pro.hero.alt": "Professional in an interview setting",
  "pro.h2.1": "What we look for",
  "pro.li1": "The right pathway: Ausbildung, healthcare professional or another skilled role",
  "pro.li2": "German B1 or B2 (C1 welcome) — ideally with evidence",
  "pro.li3": "Experience or a clear entry intention depending on the role",
  "pro.li4": "Willingness for training or permanent employment and relocation to Germany",
  "pro.h2.2": "What we do for you",
  "pro.p2": "Profile matching, interview preparation, orientation on visa and recognition — and, after a successful placement, help with housing, banking and everyday life.",
  "pro.h2.3": "Source markets",
  "pro.p3": "We identify talent across Europe and — via valid Germany pathways — also from abroad and further regions. The standard is qualification and language, not a single origin country.",
  "pro.cta": "Apply now",
  "pro.img.alt": "Professionals in a meeting setting",
  "svc.hero.h1": "Our services",
  "svc.hero.lead": "From requirements to integration: placement of qualified profiles, transparent and focused on our sectors.",
  "svc.c1.h": "Targeted specialist search",
  "svc.c1.p": "Targeted search and outreach in our four sectors.",
  "svc.c2.h": "Qualification & language screening",
  "svc.c2.p": "Checks of degree, experience and German B2/C1 before shortlist.",
  "svc.c3.h": "Interview & offer support",
  "svc.c3.p": "Coordination of conversations, feedback and progress toward a contract.",
  "svc.c4.h": "Visa and recognition",
  "svc.c4.p": "Orientation on Blue Card, skilled immigration and recognition — without replacing legal advice.",
  "svc.c5.h": "Integration support",
  "svc.c5.p": "Housing, banking, settling locally — practical help arriving in Germany.",
  "svc.c6.h": "Retained mandate and success fee",
  "svc.c6.p": "Flexible models depending on urgency and how confidential the role is.",
  "svc.note": "Note: MEDA Vermittlung provides pure placement. We do not offer temporary staffing without a licence.",
  "int.hero.h1": "Integration that supports the start",
  "int.hero.lead": "When MEDA Vermittlung brings a professional to Germany, our mandate does not end at the employment contract. We support practical arrival — discreetly, concretely and in a work context.",
  "int.hero.alt": "German city street — arriving and settling in",
  "int.h2.1": "Apartment search",
  "int.p1": "Support finding a suitable rental or interim solution: market orientation, document checks and viewing accompaniment where possible.",
  "int.h2.2": "Bank account opening",
  "int.p2": "Guidance on opening a current account — typical documents, process and what employers and authorities expect.",
  "int.h2.3": "Practical settling-in",
  "int.p3": "Registration, first authority visits, public transport, mobile contract, everyday orientation — so focus returns quickly to the new role.",
  "int.h2.4": "For employers",
  "int.p4": "Early practical support with housing, a bank account and everyday life is meant to ease the first weeks. We do not promise a specific retention outcome.",
  "int.h2.5": "For professionals",
  "int.p5": "You are not alone with German housing and bureaucracy. We help structure the first weeks.",
  "int.img1.alt": "Apartment handoff and modern flat — integration help",
  "int.img2.alt": "Life in a German city — settling in and daily life",
  "int.cta": "Ask an integration question",
  "about.hero.h1": "About MEDA Vermittlung",
  "about.hero.lead": "MEDA understands integration not as a one-off placement but as an accompanying process — digitally supported and aimed at the German labour market. Our goal is a clear, traceable integration path for international professionals and the companies that hire them.",
  "about.h2.1": "Our standard",
  "about.p1": "We are building digitally supported integration guidance that offers orientation from the day of arrival: reminders for appointments, notes on common authority steps including the immigration office, and structured settling-in steps — practical support, not representation before authorities and not legal advice. At MEDA, integration stays part of longer accompaniment after placement. Our aim is to support international professionals as they arrive and settle into the role so they can work capably — without guaranteeing authority decisions or specific outcomes. An integration agreement and an optional monthly service and support package (not an insurance product) can frame orientation and practical help with settling in.",
  "about.h2.2": "How we work",
  "about.p2": "Shortlists rather than unsorted databases. Sector understanding rather than keyword search. When we place someone, we stay with onboarding and integration.",
  "about.h2.3": "What we are not",
  "about.p3": "No temporary staffing without a licence. No mass placement without a link to the qualification. No token solutions on language or qualification, and no invented visa promises.",
  "about.img.alt": "Professional onboarding in a German office setting",
  "con.hero.h1": "Contact",
  "con.hero.lead": "Briefly describe your need — we respond in a structured, confidential and timely manner.",
