  "pro.tracks.h2": "Three main paths",
  "pro.tracks.lead": "Skilled and Ausbildung pathways can sit side by side. We place and orient, with no visa guarantee and no legal assurances.",
  "pro.tracks.note": "Note: in nursing, recognition, language and current admission policy often matter in practice. We help with orientation and placement. We do not replace the authorities and we do not promise a visa.",
