  "home.ai.kicker": "Digital assistance",
  "home.ai.h2": "We answer questions from what this website publishes.",
  "home.ai.p": "The assistant on this website answers general questions from the published pages. Personal decisions stay with our team. There is no promise of a visa, a job, or an official outcome.",
