  "mo.why.h2": "Placement, employer and settling in.",
  "mo.why.1.h": "One path, one app",
  "mo.why.1.p": "From placement to the first day at work — the employer and settling in, together. You and your employer share the same arrival plan.",
  "mo.why.2.h": "Before arrival, through to settled",
  "mo.why.2.p": "Checklists for Day 1, Week 1 and Month 1: registration, insurance, bank, doctor, authorities — and preparation before the journey.",
  "mo.why.3.h": "Ask MEDA in four languages",
  "mo.why.3.p": "Orientation in German, English, French and Arabic, always with the official source.",
  "mo.why.4.h": "AI assistant and team",
  "mo.why.4.p": "The MEDA AI assistant and our team support you personally.",
  "mo.feat.kicker": "The app",
  "mo.feat.h2": "What MEDA One brings.",
  "mo.feat.lead": "Eight building blocks are in development. “Understand a letter” is planned and not part of the first version.",
  "mo.badge.dev": "In development",
