  "mo.f1.p": "Every step with deadlines and reminders, from registration to your driving licence.",
  "mo.f2.h": "The Day-1 plan",
  "mo.f2.p": "What matters today, and what can wait until tomorrow.",
  "mo.f4.h": "Find a doctor, pharmacy or Bürgeramt",
  "mo.f4.p": "Straight to the official search services such as 116117 and the emergency pharmacy finder.",
  "mo.f5.h": "Ask MEDA, with the source",
  "mo.f5.p": "Your AI assistant explains everyday life and German terms, always with the official source.",
  "mo.f6.h": "Leben in Deutschland test",
